== Walkthrough ==

''[[Nivold Predd]] can be found inside the Tabernacle of Terror in [[Paineel]] at (1116, 518).''

You say, 'Hail, Nivold Predd'

: Nivold Predd says, 'What do you want? Do not disturb me lest you plan to assist in my [Summoning of Dread].'

You say, 'I will assist in the summoning of Dread.'

: Nivold Predd says, 'There are some components essential to the summoning of the avatar of Dread. I require the eye of a griffon, some [powder of reanimation], the brain of the Ishva Mal, and the toes of an ice giant. Fetch me these reagents so that we may summon the avatar to forge a shield worn only by the mightiest apostles of Cazic-Thule.' 

You say, 'What is powder of reanimation?'

: Nivold Predd says, 'There is a gnome necromancer who has been experimenting with a powder used in reanimating long dead organic tissue. He is known to frequent places populated by undead in order to pursue his research. Seek him out and procure a bit of his powder.'

'''Travel to [[Unrest]] and locate [[Khrix Fritchoff]] on the second floor (595, 61).'''

You say, 'Hail, Khrix Fritchoff'

: Khrix Fritchoff says 'Close the door and be gone, fool!! You are going to give away my hiding spot!!'

You say, 'I require a powder of reanimation'

: Khrix Fritchoff says, 'So you want the powder of reanimation eh? Well you can have it if you can get it from that terrible abomination I have created! Perhaps you have a Fire Beetle Eye for me so that I may see my way out of here!

'''Give him a [[Fire Beetle Eye]] (He will accept at dubious) and A [[Khrix Abomination]] will spawn in the room directly behind Khrix's closet (not in it). It is very powerful maybe 35-40.'''

: Khrix Fritchoff says 'At last I may leave this place!! Good luck destroying my abomination, you will surely need it against my most powerful yet uncontrollable creation!'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Dark Reflection]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Eldritch Collective]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Gem Choppers]] got worse.
</div>
{{YouGainExperience}}

: Khrix Abomination says, 'Grrrarrrrrg!! Har har grrrarrrrg!!'

'''Kill the Khrix Abomination and loot [[Powder of Reanimation]]. Return to [[Paineel]] and hand in the Powder of Reanimation, [[Griffon Eye]], [[Ice Giant Toes]], and the [[Brain of the Ishva Mal]] to [[Nivold Predd]].'''

: Nivold Predd says, 'Commendable work, you have proven yourself a valuable member of our order. Our chanters have summoned the avatar of Dread. Hurry and take him this mundane shield so that he may forge it into a truly valuable symbol of your devotion to the lord of Fear!'

<div class="facblock">
