''You receive a [[Mundane Shield]]. An [[Avatar of Dread]] spawns in a nearby room.''

 Avatar of dread shouts 'Grrrraaaaarrrrrg!! The stench of fear permeates the walls of this city!
 I will forge one item for the faithful of our Lord Cazic-Thule!! Make haste! My time here is short!'

